  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion (as in config_018) yield the highest accuracy so far. This experiment tests whether switching the image encoder from imagenet_vit_l to resnet50 (while keeping avgpool and weighted fusion) improves performance. It isolates the effect of the image encoder, a key design choice, and builds on the promising aggregation/fusion combination. This balances exploitation of current strong evidence with exploration of a critical component."
